# HormonePrint-overview
HormonePrint is a FemTech application focused on predictive hormonal intelligence, helping women optimize energy, mood, and performance based on their cycle.
# HormonePrint — cycle tracking evolving into “hormonal intelligence”

HormonePrint is a women’s health app that goes beyond passive cycle logging. The MVP already supports reliable period + symptom tracking, and we’re currently building the intelligence layer that turns patterns into concrete daily recommendations (sleep, training, stress, recovery).

**Status:** MVP functional. Personalization/“AI” layer in progress.

## What it does today (MVP)
- Period tracking (start/end + ongoing periods)
- Cycle basics onboarding (cycle length, regularity, last period details)
- Symptom tracking + history
- Calendar highlighting logged period days

## What we’re building next (intelligence layer)
- Personalized predictions that learn from each user’s patterns (energy, mood, pain, sleep)
- Just-in-time nudges based on context (cycle phase + symptoms + habits)
- Optional integration with health/wearables data (only with explicit consent)

## Why it matters
Most cycle apps stop at date predictions and generic tips. Users still have to interpret symptoms alone. HormonePrint is designed to translate cycle + behavior signals into actionable decisions, reducing mental load and improving daily planning.

